WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.201 --> 00:00:00.955
- We are so excited.

00:00:00.955 --> 00:00:02.887
We just found out that our
favorite childhood lollies

00:00:02.887 --> 00:00:04.547
have been transformed into ice cream.

00:00:04.547 --> 00:00:06.389
So we're here today to try it.

00:00:06.389 --> 00:00:07.475
We're ready, bring it on.

00:00:07.475 --> 00:00:12.458
(upbeat music)

00:00:13.328 --> 00:00:14.721
So this is Peppermint Crisp and as soon

00:00:14.721 --> 00:00:16.532
as it was put in the bowl, I can smell it

00:00:16.532 --> 00:00:18.253
and it smells like childhood.

00:00:18.253 --> 00:00:20.203
- I'm really gonna enjoy
this, 'cause I like peppermint

00:00:20.203 --> 00:00:21.965
and I like crisp and I like chocolate

00:00:21.965 --> 00:00:23.782
and I like ice cream.

00:00:23.782 --> 00:00:24.690
- Yes!

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:25.518
(laughter)

00:00:25.518 --> 00:00:26.424
I feel this.

00:00:26.424 --> 00:00:27.480
- That is so good.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:28.396
- Cold toothpaste.

00:00:28.396 --> 00:00:29.171
- Yeah.

00:00:29.171 --> 00:00:30.801
- My grandma will go ape-shit for this.

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:32.159
- They totally pulled this off.

00:00:32.159 --> 00:00:34.061
- Yeah, this is just like crazy delicious.

00:00:35.441 --> 00:00:38.090
- So this is Milo, which is
like our version of Nesquick.

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:40.082
- It's kind of a flavor
that you don't ever forget.

00:00:40.082 --> 00:00:41.622
(growls)

00:00:41.622 --> 00:00:43.191
- Definitely got a strong Milo flavor,

00:00:43.191 --> 00:00:44.761
but it doesn't have that texture

00:00:44.761 --> 00:00:47.206
that you have when you
add Milo onto ice cream,

00:00:47.206 --> 00:00:48.776
which I think I kind of miss.

00:00:48.776 --> 00:00:50.617
- To be honest, this doesn't really taste

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:53.666
like Milo to me, this just
tastes like chocolate ice cream.

00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:56.292
- I would eat this but I
would put Milo on top still.

00:00:56.292 --> 00:00:57.077
- Yeah.

00:00:57.077 --> 00:00:58.254
- Why can't we just buy ice cream,

00:00:58.254 --> 00:01:00.578
put some Milo on it, mix it around,

00:01:00.578 --> 00:01:02.419
and you know, save about five bucks?

00:01:02.419 --> 00:01:03.385
- It's fine.

00:01:04.228 --> 00:01:06.126
- Fantales are an iconic Australian lolly,

00:01:06.126 --> 00:01:07.414
so I'm really excited for this.

00:01:07.414 --> 00:01:10.100
- There's no quiz or anything
about Australian celebrities.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:11.308
That's a missed opportunity.

00:01:11.308 --> 00:01:12.093
That would've been fun.

00:01:12.093 --> 00:01:13.159
- This is one of the ones that

00:01:13.159 --> 00:01:14.236
you can't really fake at home,

00:01:14.236 --> 00:01:16.198
so I'm pretty excited
they've done it for us.

00:01:16.198 --> 00:01:18.069
- I feel like if a Caramello Koala

00:01:18.069 --> 00:01:20.574
was ice cream, it would
be very much so like this.

00:01:20.574 --> 00:01:22.768
- No, this is better than a
Caramello Koala ice cream.

00:01:22.768 --> 00:01:23.955
- Tastes like they got their hands

00:01:23.955 --> 00:01:26.430
on the Gaytime ice cream that
probably didn't sell great

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:28.302
and they were like,
what do we do with this?

00:01:28.302 --> 00:01:29.902
- They definitely pulled this one off.

00:01:30.892 --> 00:01:32.247
I just love Smarties.

00:01:32.247 --> 00:01:33.756
I reckon they're so much better than M&amp;Ms.

00:01:33.756 --> 00:01:35.235
- I'm really not expecting much, though.

00:01:35.235 --> 00:01:36.322
I'm probably expecting chocolate

00:01:36.322 --> 00:01:37.620
- [Both] ice cream, with

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:39.130
- some chunks of Smartie in it,

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:40.277
which is just chocolate.

00:01:40.277 --> 00:01:42.088
- Tastes like chocolate ice
cream with Smarties in it.

00:01:42.088 --> 00:01:43.597
- You can easily just do this on the cheap

00:01:43.597 --> 00:01:45.801
with cheap ice cream and real Smarties.

00:01:45.801 --> 00:01:47.219
- To be honest, I'd rather just have

00:01:47.219 --> 00:01:48.517
an M&amp;M McFlurry.

00:01:48.517 --> 00:01:50.177
- Because M&amp;Ms are better.

00:01:51.367 --> 00:01:54.176
- Fruit Tingles are just an
iconic part of your childhood.

00:01:54.176 --> 00:01:55.716
So to have that in ice cream form

00:01:55.716 --> 00:01:57.105
is just like a nostalgia hit.

00:01:57.105 --> 00:01:58.342
- This is not something that I feel

00:01:58.342 --> 00:01:59.730
you can really do at home.

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:02.085
- This just tastes like
straight happiness.

00:02:02.085 --> 00:02:05.073
- Tastes like the ice cream
version of those bananas.

00:02:05.073 --> 00:02:06.250
- Yellow is definitely the worst

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:08.162
Fruit Tingle flavor and that's
what I'm getting in this.

00:02:08.162 --> 00:02:09.350
So I'm not into it.

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:11.170
- I just feel with this one
they could've maybe tried

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:12.468
a bit harder to make the ice cream

00:02:12.468 --> 00:02:13.464
taste like a Fruit Tingle.

00:02:13.464 --> 00:02:14.883
- Like, actually taking Fruit Tingles

00:02:14.883 --> 00:02:16.815
and like turned that into ice cream.

00:02:16.815 --> 00:02:18.505
Not just adding Fruit
Tingles to ice cream.

00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:19.260
- Yeah!

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:21.192
- Like, well, really
Fruit Tingles weren't made

00:02:21.192 --> 00:02:22.550
to be turned into an ice cream.

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:23.788
That's a bad idea.

00:02:23.788 --> 00:02:25.840
- After today, I really
feel like I got reminded

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:28.000
with a lot of childhood flavors.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.463
But I kinda feel like I
was taken down that road

00:02:30.463 --> 00:02:31.792
in a cheats way.

00:02:31.792 --> 00:02:33.361
- Some of them worked, some didn't.

00:02:33.361 --> 00:02:34.901
- It's okay, but I feel
like you could just

00:02:34.901 --> 00:02:36.440
do a cheap version at home.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:40.198
(upbeat music)

